--- a call whose argument's making was refused (an undefined function's) is
--- typed as the copy a call with nothing known reaches — relu's, copied per
--- signature, had been the matrix's — and what is written into its answer
--- (an item, a field, the variable again) had each been judged by that
--- copy's kind: the mistake is told once (fuzz seed 1793066246)
use math

g = relu[zeros[2, 3]]
v = relu[nosuch[linspace[0.0, 1.0, 3]]]
v[2] = 4.2
v.x = 1
v = 3
log[g]
log[v]

--- the formulas the program uses (pie's nn holds the library)
fn relu[x]
    x_t = tensor[x]
    return clip[x_t, 0.0, inf]
